  "title": "EU AI Act Article 50(2) provider marking — engineering readiness",
  "applies_from": "2026-08-02",
  "scope_note": "Engineering test profile for provider-side machine-readable marking and detectability of synthetic audio, image, video and text. It operationalises test dimensions only and does not determine legal scope, exemptions, technical feasibility, compliance or conformity.",
